										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475547876_805719227954792081_568175523960779561", {"feature":"805719227954792081","feature2":"568175523960779561","owner":"103582791475547876","commentthreadid":"661407663","total_count":4,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":1246871744,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":4200110,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"569301473354081947":{"text":"You correctly spotted the Unreal Engine logo in the game! \n\nI'd love to dive more into your thoughts on the game. Can you share more on what makes you believe it is slop? \n\nI also invite you to join our Discord and join in our discussions: http:\/\/discord.gg\/playnekome","author":"Probably_TIm"},"569301473354127268":{"text":"[quote=Probably_TIm;569301473354081947]You correctly spotted the Unreal Engine logo in the game! \n\nI'd love to dive more into your thoughts on the game. Can you share more on what makes you believe it is slop? \n\nI also invite you to join our Discord and join in our discussions: http:\/\/discord.gg\/playnekome [\/quote]\n\nplayed similar games but with different themes. the jank comes from the combat mechanics, dont work well with hall effect keyboard properly. typical unreal engine slop? yes. horrible performance, yes ik its a demo but if the first impression is like this then yea, its not good. sub 50fps on a decently moderate PC is crazy. and then again it comes down devs not being able to optimize the shite unreal engine 5 anyways.","author":"bRKN"},"569301473354130105":{"text":"Thanks for getting back to me! The performance issues have been reported back to the team and they are looking at it more closely. The team is also constantly working to optimize Nekome as we move towards launch. \n\nWhat other games come to mind when you played Nekome? Curious what mechanics you felt were similar. \n\nThanks again for checking out Nekome.","author":"Probably_TIm"},"569301473354142262":{"text":"[quote=Probably_TIm;569301473354130105]Thanks for getting back to me! The performance issues have been reported back to the team and they are looking at it more closely. The team is also constantly working to optimize Nekome as we move towards launch. \n\nWhat other games come to mind when you played Nekome? Curious what mechanics you felt were similar. \n\nThanks again for checking out Nekome. [\/quote]\nto me its just sifu with balatro","author":"bRKN"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
