			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_569301473354127268">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c569301473354081947">Probably_TIm</a></b>:</div>You correctly spotted the Unreal Engine logo in the game! <br><br>I'd love to dive more into your thoughts on the game. Can you share more on what makes you believe it is slop? <br><br>I also invite you to join our Discord and join in our discussions: <a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=http%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2Fplaynekome" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >http://discord.gg/playnekome</a> </blockquote><br>played similar games but with different themes. the jank comes from the combat mechanics, dont work well with hall effect keyboard properly. typical unreal engine slop? yes. horrible performance, yes ik its a demo but if the first impression is like this then yea, its not good. sub 50fps on a decently moderate PC is crazy. and then again it comes down devs not being able to optimize the ♥♥♥♥♥ unreal engine 5 anyways.			</div>
