								<div class="forum_topic_name" title="i was pretty hyped to play the demo once it released but i have quite a few issues. the combat is very much one button spam where you occasionally press another button to counter and even more rarely the block break button. enemies dont fight back mid combo so you never have to worry about the enemy youre attacking just the ones that surround you. not to mention the power attacks are completely bugged. every time i pick up the second focus attack options my focus attacks no longer work and just become regu">
									<a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/4200110/discussions/0/568175240219391842/">
										demo is not looking good									</a>
								</div>
							</div>
